## 5. Personas

| ID | Persona | Goal | Home tier |
|----|---------|------|-----------|
| **P-A** | **Maya** — Staff Engineer decomposing a refactor | Externalize a large refactor into a concrete, reviewable, parallelizable plan | **G3** (some G4) |
| **P-B** | **Devon** — Tech Lead delegating work | Slice a feature across 3–5 engineers/agents so pieces progress in parallel and reconverge cleanly | **G3–G4** |
| **P-C** | **Sam** — Solo dev shipping a feature | Plan & ship fast; run independent pieces (route/UI/tests) at once | **G2** (the sweet spot) |
| **P-D** | **Río** — Agent-fleet operator | Drive migrations/scaffolds by fanning many nodes to many builder agents at max safe concurrency | **G4** |
| **P-E** | **Partner Team** — external design-partner squad | Use Trellis as a shared operable planning surface with safe role-based permissions | **G2–G3** |

The scripted demo (deliverable **D17**) is assembled from **UC-2 (parallel dispatch) + UC-4
(subtree delegation + integration) + UC-1/UC-6 (tier range) + UC-8 (drift / re-plan)**. The
canonical demo repo is **`acme-app`** (Next.js + Supabase with existing email/password login,
so OAuth is a believable addition exercising the symbol graph).

