| `queue.ts` | BullMQ `getQueue(name)` (shared ioredis), `createRedis()` (fresh conn for blocking SSE `XREAD`), `closeQueues()`. |
| `supabase.ts` | Singleton service-role Supabase client (bypasses RLS). |
| `mcp/server.ts` | MCP server over **stdio**; tools `trellis_plan`, `trellis_get_plan`, `trellis_status`, `trellis_run_branch`. Reuses the same services as REST. |
