| `routes/projects.ts` | `POST /v1/projects`, `GET /v1/projects`. |
| `routes/plans.ts` | `POST /v1/plans`, `GET /v1/plans/:id`, `POST /v1/plans/:id/replan`, `/run`, `/delegate`. |
