| `services/*.ts` | Business logic: `plans` (create/getGraph/replan + `NotFoundError`), `runs` (dispatch/runSelection/runBranch), `projects`, `shares`, `delegations` (subtree serialize + Storage upload + paired share), `feedback`, `summary` (text renderers for MCP). |

