| `branches` | Parallelizable lane: `plan_id, label, node_ids uuid[], status (idle), assignee_user_id, worktree_path, independent_of uuid[]`. |
| `plan_nodes` | The atom: `plan_id, revision, title, change_type, granularity, status (pending), summary, touch_set jsonb, position jsonb, branch_id, parent_node_id, worktree_ref, diff_artifact_path, confidence (0.5)`. |
| `node_annotations` | 1:1 with node (PK = node_id): `revision, assumptions, analysis, benefits, notable_symbols, widget_specs (all jsonb), model, tokens, cost, generated_at`. |
