## 19. The web frontend (`apps/web`)

**Next.js 15 (App Router), React 18, TanStack Query (server state), Zustand (UI state),
Tailwind, React Flow + dagre.** Core principle: the agent never writes UI HTML — it writes a
validated spec (`LayoutSpec` + `WidgetSpec[]`), and a **trusted client registry** renders from a
closed component set. **No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML` / eval anywhere.**

### Routes

- `/` (`app/page.tsx`) — home: hero, `<PromptBox>` (create a plan from a prompt), feature grid,
  `<PlanList>` (recent plans).
- `/p/[id]` (`app/p/[id]/page.tsx`) — `<CanvasPage>`: the generative canvas + inspector.
- `app/layout.tsx` — fonts, no-flash dark-mode script, `<Providers>` (QueryClient).

### Canvas (`components/canvas/`)

- **`GraphCanvas`** — React Flow surface; custom `nodeTypes` (`planNode`, `superNode`) and
  `edgeTypes` (`planEdge`); picks the canvas from `layout_spec.canvas`; positions via
  `computeLayout()`. Injects the live run overlay into node data; `Background`, `Controls`,
  `MiniMap` (G4), `SwimlaneBands` (G3).
- **`PlanNodeView` / `SuperNodeView`** — node face is a pure function of `change_type` (icon +
  accent), `node_status` (border/glow, pulse when running), `confidence`, `emphasis`, branch
  tint + `∥` for independent branches, `⚠` false-independence flag, hover Run/Open, live
  progress bar.
- **`PlanEdgeView`** — typed edge with a **hover evidence popover** (reason, shared symbols,
  `from_provides → to_consumes`, overlap score → "safe to parallelize" / "serialize"). No
  evidence → honest "unverified — no engine evidence".
- **`CanvasToolbar`** — spec-driven CTAs from `layout_spec.parallelism_ui` /
  `delegation_ui`; soft-edge toggle; Add context; Share.
- **`SelectionBanner`** — multi-select → `analyzeIndependence()` → "⚡ parallel-safe" or
  "cannot parallelize — shared files".

### Inspector (`components/inspector/`)

- **`NodeInspector`** — right drawer; default tab from `layout_spec.default_inspector_tab`;
  header (change-type badge, status, branch tint, confidence, false-independence banner);
  action bar (**Run / Share / Delegate subtree / Add context**); live `RunLog`; the change-type
  widget(s); the five section tabs.
- **`Sections`** — the five grounded sections: `ChangesSection` (touch-set add/modify/delete +
  resolved files + signatures + confidence), `AssumptionsSection`, `AnalysisSection`
  (severity-sorted risks), `BenefitsSection`, `NotableSymbolsSection`. Each claim shows a
  confidence meter, 👍/👎 feedback, and a citation (or low-confidence label).
- **`RunLog`** — live streamed run viewer (progress %, tokens, rolling log tail).
- **`ActionDialogs`** — `ShareDialog`, `DelegateDialog`, `AddContextDialog`.

### Widgets (`components/widgets/`)

`registry.tsx` is the **trusted closed registry**: `REGISTRY: Partial<Record<WidgetKind,
{propsSchema (zod), Component, maxPropsBytes}>>`. Registered: `schema_diff` (64KB),
`api_contract` (64KB), `component_preview` (64KB), `call_graph_impact` (128KB), `key_diff`
(32KB). `renderWidget()` validates the envelope → looks up the widget → size-caps props →
validates props → renders the trusted component, falling back to a `FallbackWidget` at every
failure. **Never throws.**

| Widget | change_type | Renders |
|--------|-------------|---------|
| `schema_diff` | migration | before/after table columns with per-row Δ + migration ordering |
| `api_contract` | api_contract | method/path, request/response tables, breaking-change block |
| `component_preview` | ui_component | skeleton structural preview (no execution) + prop/state tables |
| `call_graph_impact` | logic/refactor | indented caller/callee tree by depth + blast-radius summary |
| `key_diff` | config | before→after key table + consumer list |

### State, data, realtime, design

- **`lib/store.ts`** (Zustand) — selection, layout/density, and the **live run overlay**
  (`runProgress[nodeId] = {status, progress, log[], tokens}`).
- **`lib/hooks.ts`** (TanStack Query) — `usePlanList`, `usePlanGraph` (wires Supabase Realtime →
  invalidation), `useRunNodes` (optimistic), `useReplan`, `useDelegate`, `useShare`,
  `useFeedback`. All hooks **gracefully fall back to bundled fixtures** when the API/Supabase is
  unconfigured.
- **`lib/api.ts`** — typed `/v1` client; `subscribeRunStream()` opens an SSE `EventSource` on
  `/v1/runs/:id/stream`.
- **`lib/supabase.ts`** — browser client; `subscribePlanRealtime()` subscribes to
  `postgres_changes` on `plan_nodes`, `runs`, `plan_edges`, `branches` (filtered by `plan_id`),
  invalidating the plan query so the canvas re-flows.
- **`lib/layout.ts` + `lib/dagre.ts`** — the per-canvas layout strategies (checklist /
  compact_dag / swimlane / hierarchical).
- **`lib/design.ts` + `components/ui/`** — the visual language (change-type/status/edge/severity
  tokens, branch tints), primitives, overlay (Dialog/Sheet), and the **trust surface**
  (Citation, GroundingChip, ClaimFeedback).
- **`lib/fixtures.ts`** — four demo `PlanGraph`s (one per tier) so the entire UI renders
  end-to-end with no backend.

