## 22. Realtime & streaming

Two distinct live channels — don't conflate them:

| Channel | Transport | Carries | Path |
|---------|-----------|---------|------|
| **Run progress** (transient) | **SSE** (`EventSource`) | per-run log lines, tool calls, file edits, status, tokens | worker `RunStream` → Redis `stream:run:{id}` → API `GET /v1/runs/:id/stream` → Zustand overlay |
| **Graph changes** (durable) | **Supabase Realtime** (`postgres_changes`) | inserts/updates on `plan_nodes`, `runs`, `plan_edges`, `branches` | DB → browser channel `plan:{id}` → TanStack Query invalidation → canvas re-flow |

The API's SSE route opens a **dedicated** ioredis connection per client and blocks on
`XREAD BLOCK 0`, with a 15s heartbeat; it cleans up on disconnect.

